Note on game assets:
The original game binary `capoo.swf` (extracted from the original release APK)
and the bundled artwork are the work of the original author(s) of "Capoo /
摸摸手 / Touch Hands". This project only ships the open-source revival boot
shim (src/Boot.as) and the build tooling. The original game content remains the
property of its respective owner; this repository is a fan-made revival for
preservation and play, not a claim of ownership over the game itself.
